  "html": "<div id=\"step-e2761\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block;\">\n    \n                 \n                <div class=\"example\">\n                    <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                        <div class=\"stepName\"><span class=\"stepType\">Example:</span> Identifying the Net of a Polyhedron</div>       \n                        <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"e2761\">?</div>\n                    </div>\n            \n                    <div class=\"exampleQuestion\">\n                        <div id=\"graphic-6f6ec633437508eae898016db3599a8e\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/6f6ec633437508eae898016db3599a8e\"></div> \n\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Which of the nets above is the net of a rectangular prism?  </p>\n\n                    </div>     \n            \n                    <div class=\"exampleExplanationHeader\">EXPLANATION</div>\n            \n                    <div class=\"exampleExplanation\">\n                        <div id=\"graphic-576da1bf73d721f27a4eca6ea7968c5f\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/576da1bf73d721f27a4eca6ea7968c5f\"></div> \n\n<p><br></p>\n<p>If we were to fold the net above along its edges, then we'd get a rectangular prism, as shown below: </p>\n<p><br></p>\n<div id=\"graphic-29330498723fb2c3c02be93f0f252798\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/29330498723fb2c3c02be93f0f252798\"></div>  \n\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Notice that the other two nets have triangular faces, so they cannot be the nets of a rectangular prism. </p>\n<p>Therefore, the correct answer is I.</p>\n\n                    </div>     \n                </div>                            \n                    \n            </div>",
